            "Przyjechała przedwczoraj.",
            "She arrived the day before yesterday."
          ],
          ["rano", "in the morning", "Rano piję kawę.", "I drink coffee in the morning."],
          [
            "po południu",
            "in the afternoon",
            "Po południu mam czas.",
            "I have time in the afternoon."
